# Definition of Done (WORKING)

A feature/task/bugfix is **WORKING** only when:

- The **actual purpose is fulfilled** (from the user’s perspective), and
- It has been **tested in the same way the real user/system will use it**.

## External integrations

If the purpose involves **external systems** (Shopify, webhooks, public downloads, etc.), testing must include an **external internet** check when relevant.

### Example: Shopify image downloads

- Do not consider “image serving” done just because local URLs load.
- Verify the image is reachable from the outside world (e.g. the Cloudflare Tunnel URL) and returns:
  - **HTTP 200**
  - **Correct `Content-Type`** (e.g. `image/jpeg`, `image/png`)
